 "remarks": "Last unit available-move-in special for immediate occupancy! Experience luxury townhouse living in Mid-City Stamford with this rare opportunity to rent at 1911 Summer Street, located in an upscale, brand-new 2026 building in the heart of downtown Stamford. This beautifully designed 3-bedroom, 2 1/2-bathroom townhouse offers approximately 1,980 square feet of modern living space, city views, thoughtfully appointed interiors, and a one-car garage. The spacious layout is ideal for comfortable living and entertaining, while the convenient location provides easy access to downtown restaurants, shopping, entertainment, transportation, and major roadways. Nearby stores and amenities include Stop & Shop, Starbucks, LA Fitness, CVS Pharmacy, Whole Foods Market, Michaels, Burlington, Target, and Stamford Town Center, all within walking distance or a short drive. Don't miss this exceptional opportunity to enjoy stylish, convenient, and elevated living in one of Stamford's most desirable locations.",
